# {{package_name}} Package

Package for managing {{package_name}} functionality.

## Features

- CRUD operations for {{model_name}}
- Admin panel integration
- Permission-based access control

## Structure

```
{{package_name}}/
├── configs/
│   └── permissions.php
├── database/migrations/
├── resources/views/
├── routes/
│   ├── web.php
│   └── admin.php
└── src/
    ├── Http/Controllers/
    ├── Models/
    ├── Providers/
    ├── Repositories/
    └── Services/
```

## Usage

Package is automatically loaded via ServiceProvider in `composer.json`.

### Routes

Admin routes are available at `/admin/{{package_lower}}/`

### Permissions

- `{{package_lower}}.index` - View list
- `{{package_lower}}.create` - Create new
- `{{package_lower}}.edit` - Edit existing
- `{{package_lower}}.delete` - Delete
